 oup\, CIA agents Chris (John Malkovich) and Lee (Sam Rockwell) are dispatc
 hed from Santiago to Easter island by their bureau chief\, MJ (Steve Busce
 mi). Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and as the longtime partners wr
 estle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies\, Chris's newfound bo
